        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "bd6453cc-4981-532a-aa17-86a4ee48f359",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Frederick Brewing Company, Flying Dog Brewery, Wild Goose Brewery\n- People: Marjorie McGinnis, Kevin Brannon, Steve Nordahl, George Stranahan, Richard McIntyre\n- Events: founding, grand opening, receivership, acquisition, renaming\n\nFacts:\n- Flying Dog Brewery was founded in 1990 by George Stranahan and Richard McIntyre.\n- Frederick Brewing Company was founded sometime between 1992 and 1993 by Marjorie McGinnis, Kevin Brannon, and Steve Nordahl.\n- Frederick Brewing Company had its grand opening on 12 February 1997.\n- Frederick Brewing Company was placed into receivership in early 2002 or 2003.\n- In 2006, Flying Dog Brewery purchased Frederick Brewing Company and renamed it Wild Goose Brewery.\n- Flying Dog Brewery is the largest brewery in Maryland.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "acb415c5-de65-5a6c-afa6-bea39258def2",
        "text": "Page: Frederick Brewing Company. Sentence: It was founded sometime between 1992 and 1993 by Marjorie McGinnis, Kevin Brannon, and Steve Nordahl and had its grand opening on 12 February 1997.\nPage: Frederick Brewing Company. Sentence: In early 2002 or 2003 the company was placed into receivership and in 2006 was purchased by Flying Dog Brewery and renamed Wild Goose Brewery.\nPage: Flying Dog Brewery. Sentence: Founded in 1990 by George Stranahan and Richard McIntyre, it is the largest brewery in Maryland.",
        "type": "DocumentChunk"
